service('inventory-management-system-development','Inventory management systems','Know what is in stock, where it is and what happens next.','grid','Products and stock|Warehouses|Purchase and sales orders|Barcode management|Stock transfers|Stock movement history','Manual stock updates can leave teams with conflicting counts and little visibility into how inventory changed.','We define the stock movement model and validation rules first. Receiving, dispatch and transfers update inventory through recorded transactions so teams can trace adjustments and investigate differences.')
