project('bharat-medical-backoffice-management-system','Bharat Medical Hall','Bharat Medical','medical','Healthcare / Medical retail','Laravel|Healthcare', 'A centralized back-office system for orders, employees and everyday medical retail operations.','Order management|Employee management|Attendance management|User management|Role-based access control|Administrative management|Operational management','Medical retail operations involve more than fulfilling orders. Staff records, attendance and administrative responsibilities also need a consistent home. The project addressed the need to manage these internal processes from a centralized platform.','The back-office application brings order, employee and attendance management together, with role-based access to administrative functions. The structure gives the team one place to manage operational records.','I developed the custom back-office management system described here, including order, employee, attendance and user-management functionality.','The system provides a centralized workflow for internal operations. It supports clearer ownership of records and reduces the need to move between separate administrative processes. Quantified performance results have not been supplied.','healthcare-management-system-development|admin-panel-development','Role-based operations')
project('treeva-healthcare-management-system','Treeva Healthcare','Treeva Healthcare','treeva','Healthcare','Laravel|Healthcare|Website','A public-facing healthcare website connected to a complete patient and operations platform.','Patient management|Appointment management|Enquiry management|Billing and invoices|Expense management|Service management|Staff management|Users and permissions','The public-facing experience needed to explain healthcare services and collect patient enquiries and appointment requests. The internal team also needed a place to manage those requests alongside patient records, billing and daily operations.','The project combines a lead-focused public website with a healthcare administration platform. Enquiries and appointment requests become inputs to the operational workflow, while billing, services and staff are managed within the admin system.','My work covered the public website and the administration functionality outlined in this case study, connecting enquiry generation with healthcare operations.','The website and admin platform support a connected journey from initial enquiry to appointment and billing. The operational value is a shared workflow; no patient-growth or revenue figures are claimed.','healthcare-management-system-development|custom-web-application-development','Website + administration')
project('education-management-saas','Education Management SaaS','Campus / SaaS','education','Education','Laravel|SaaS','An institution management platform designed around scalable SaaS architecture.','Student management|Staff management|Attendance|Fee management|Academic management|User roles|Institution administration','Educational institutions need to coordinate student information, staff, attendance, academics and fees. A SaaS model adds the requirement to serve multiple institutions while maintaining appropriate organizational boundaries.','The platform groups institutional workflows within a SaaS application. Tenant-aware access and shared application architecture provide a foundation for adding institutions without duplicating the product for each organization.','My contribution focused on the education-management functionality and SaaS architecture described here, covering institutional records, permissions and administrative workflows.','The platform provides institutions with a consistent way to manage academic and administrative information. Its architecture supports growth across organizations; capacity and usage figures require production measurement.','saas-development|custom-web-application-development','Multi-tenant platform', 'Laravel|MySQL|SaaS')
project('crm-business-management-platform','CRM & Business Platform','Pipeline / CRM','crm','Sales / Business operations','Laravel|CRM|ERP','Connected leads, customer records and follow-ups for a more organized sales workflow.','Lead management|Customer management|Task management|Follow-ups|Activity tracking|Notifications|Sales process management','Sales teams need visibility into lead ownership, previous conversations and the next action. When those details are separated, following up consistently becomes difficult.','CRM functionality connects leads and customers with tasks, follow-ups and activity history. Sales process management gives the team a shared view of where an opportunity stands and what should happen next.','I developed CRM functionality covering the lead, customer, activity and task workflows described in this project.','Connected records make sales activity easier to review and help the team identify pending follow-ups. No conversion-rate or revenue improvements are asserted.','crm-development|erp-development','Connected sales workflows',screenshots=[{'src':'/assets/img/portfolio/crm/ERP1.png','alt':'Existing CRM dashboard asset showing navigation, analytics and activity overview'},{'src':'/assets/img/portfolio/crm/ERP2.png','alt':'Existing CRM application interface'}])
project('hrms-payroll-system','HRMS & Payroll System','People / HRMS','hrms','Human resources','Laravel|HRMS','Attendance, leave policies and payroll brought together in a structured employee management system.','Employee management|Attendance|Biometric integration|Leave management|Comp off|Shift management|Timesheets|Payroll|Salary templates|Payslip generation|Policies|Notifications','Payroll depends on more than a total of hours worked. Shift assignments, biometric events, leave balances, comp off and policy exceptions all affect the inputs that must be reviewed.','The HRMS connects employee records, attendance, leave and timesheets with payroll preparation. Salary templates and payslip generation support a repeatable payroll workflow, while policy handling accounts for the rules that shape attendance and leave decisions.','My development work covered the HRMS and payroll functionality listed here, including biometric attendance integration and the related employee-policy workflows.','The system brings payroll inputs into a connected process and helps make attendance and leave decisions more consistent. Payroll accuracy and time savings should be measured against real usage rather than assumed.','hrms-development|api-development-integration','Policy-driven workflows')
project('warehouse-management-system','Warehouse Management System','Warehouse / WMS','warehouse','Logistics / Warehousing','Laravel|Inventory|ERP|API','An operational platform connecting inbound, putaway, retrieval and inventory control.','Inbound management|Putaway|Storage and retrieval|Warehouse management|Inventory management|Cycle counting|Barcode integration|ERP integration|TMS integration','Warehouse operations depend on accurate location and movement information. Receiving, storing and retrieving stock must remain consistent with the inventory data used by connected ERP and transport systems.','The WMS organizes inventory through inbound, putaway, storage and retrieval workflows. Cycle counting and barcode integration support physical operations, with ERP and TMS integration connecting warehouse events to surrounding business systems.','I developed warehouse-management functionality across the workflows and integrations described in this case study.','The system supports traceable stock movements and a more consistent operational view of inventory. Inventory accuracy is a goal of the workflow; no unverified accuracy percentage is presented.','warehouse-management-system-development|inventory-management-system-development|api-development-integration','Warehouse + integrations')

